# Books are working data, not source, and they are disposable by design: once
# pub_yt_x uploads one it deletes everything beside progress.json. Tracking a
# folder the publisher is going to wipe only means committing 74 deletions
# afterwards. `content_to_be_processed*/` above already covers books kept in
# the v1 location; this is for one worked on at the repo root.
